{"server":"en","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_04_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_04","title":"Turn State's Evidence","storyCode":"GT-4","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"685a8272419135448fc6d0afd1e59f44d1cc9625902e34b9852b92294d34914e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This one's limping! Take him out first!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"Grani! At this rate, we're all gonna be dead meat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if that's the case...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"Quick! Take Carol and go!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll only end up slowing you down with this bad leg!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll find a way to meet up with you later! Hurry!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"It's a promise then! Make sure to come get your share of the treasure!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"...Heh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"Just go!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"They ran away!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Big Bob","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, who wants to play?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"...The sounds of fighting are quieting down."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"But we can't afford to rest yet, Carol. Sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine... But, Mister Bob... what about him...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"He might need some time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Need some time...? Are you saying..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Oww!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Carol! Are you okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, I just tripped over this root..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Here, take my hand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"...Thank you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Can you walk?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm fine, it's just a bruise. As you said, it's best that we keep moving..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Once we cross this forest, we'll reach the foot of Mt. Mortica. We need to find the second cave halfway up the mountain."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"We can only get in through the cave entrance?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah. Once inside, we'll still have to follow some paths in the darkness, but I know the way. The treasure is hidden in the deepest part of the cave."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Mhm. Well, in that case..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Woah?! Was that an explosion going off in the distance...? Th-that can't be good..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Listen closely, there's the sound of screaming as well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Someone's fighting. It's not over yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"...Carol, are you scared?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"...Yes, I am."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"But in order to protect my village and return peace to these lands... I have to do this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"I see..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"You're really brave."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Carol","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry about it. Anyway, let's keep moving."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["Grani"]}]}
